    "name": "Ultimate Snake",
    "steam_appid": 3061330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the Snake game, featuring classic modes, a plethora of levels, diverse gaming modes, personalized level customization, and vibrant color themes.<br><br>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/e5f7dfa4a9158c7badbb80c76204882d.webp?t=1724196881\" width=397 height=38 /></span><br><br>~ Classic Mode ~  <br>After meticulous research on mobile snake games, the classic mode brings you the most authentic snake experience. Details such as movement, collision, and button feedback have been carefully tuned to replicate the essence of the original snake game. Furthermore, the classic mode offers a global leaderboard, allowing you to compete with friends and family.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/7f1fd9281b92036822ca5b0f52e83e0a.webp?t=1724196881\" width=205 height=56 /></span><br><br>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/e5f7dfa4a9158c7badbb80c76204882d.webp?t=1724196881\" width=397 height=38 /></span><br><br>~ Player VS Computer ~<br>In the Player vs. Computer mode, a new challenge awaits you! You can freely adjust the difficulty of the AI, choosing an opponent that matches your skill level, from easy to difficult. Face off against a smart snake controlled by the computer and showcase your abilities to become the true champion of the snake game!<br>~ Entertainment Mode ~  <br>Tired of traditional snake gameplay? Want to try some novel elements? Look no further than entertainment mode! Here, you can let your snake feast on fruits, pass through walls, or even perform other stunts, enjoying the endless possibilities of snake gaming.<br><br>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/22984b6bc20c0206f03f68450374a25d.avif?t=1724196881\" width=640 height=418 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/441d6a427040661685a9ada168bc45bc.avif?t=1724196881\" width=172 height=140 /></span><br><br>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/e5f7dfa4a9158c7badbb80c76204882d.webp?t=1724196881\" width=397 height=38 /></span><br><br>~ Level Mode ~  <br>Whether you prefer a gradual challenge or want to guide your snake through a maze, the level mode caters to your needs. Dozens of well-designed levels await your challenge, so come and show off your skills!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/d985380b2aea61b76921aad559c8510a.avif?t=1724196881\" width=422 height=276 /></span><br><br>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/e5f7dfa4a9158c7badbb80c76204882d.webp?t=1724196881\" width=397 height=38 /></span><br><br>~ Custom Levels ~  <br>If the existing levels don't satisfy you, why not try creating your own custom levels? With just a text editor, you can easily create unique levels tailored to your preferences. You decide the length of the snake, speed, map boundaries, fruit quantity, and obstacle placement\u2014unleash your creativity and build levels exclusive to you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/2239a55bb3dd0b4620300d4e28d2df99.avif?t=1724196881\" width=296 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/d63b01ab7148354c9de7193aa8776937.avif?t=1724196881\" width=320 height=138 /></span><br><br>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/e5f7dfa4a9158c7badbb80c76204882d.webp?t=1724196881\" width=397 height=38 /></span><br><br>~ Replay ~  <br>The game's replay feature offers players a unique opportunity to revisit and review their gameplay. By accurately recording every action and decision in the game, you can relive the entire gaming experience from a spectator's perspective after the game ends. Additionally, the replay feature serves as a platform for sharing and learning, allowing you to share your impressive moments with friends or family while also gaining inspiration and experience from watching other players' replays, moving forward together.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/7101a318ed0b894729460d390b5839fb.avif?t=1724196881\" width=448 height=336 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/06b275080b310a539b725841ebbd939e.avif?t=1724196881\" width=448 height=336 /></span><br><br>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/e5f7dfa4a9158c7badbb80c76204882d.webp?t=1724196881\" width=397 height=38 /></span><br><br>~ Color Themes ~  <br>The game comes with a variety of color themes for you to choose from. If these aren't enough, you can further customize additional color themes by modifying configuration files. The interface will display all the themes you've created, making it easy for you to switch between them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/ae4adc322966c4c34b4c5934482bb6ca.avif?t=1724196881\" width=322 height=148 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/73d8bc845cc91218e17524f693d55d76.avif?t=1724196881\" width=262 height=156 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/theme.png?t=1724196881\" width=262 height=156 /></span><br><br>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/e5f7dfa4a9158c7badbb80c76204882d.webp?t=1724196881\" width=397 height=38 /></span><br><br>~ Multi-language Support ~  <br>To meet the needs of players from different regions, the game supports multiple languages. Not only can you use the languages provided with the game, but you can also create your own language configuration files, making the game more closely related to your cultural background.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/71d301b8bcd6ece4d4ade2a200484e05.avif?t=1724196881\" width=320 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/015aaaff86db0bdf81ec692fb5724b17.avif?t=1724196881\" width=270 height=158 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/0e4ebf0dcf2adc68ecf5d66c0c91a858.avif?t=1724196881\" width=176 height=124 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/2e49fb03f6bd5a6bfebbf054d6cd2fbd.avif?t=1724196881\" width=230 height=124 /></span>",
