color themes by modifying configuration files. The interface will display all the themes you've created, making it easy for you to switch between them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/ae4adc322966c4c34b4c5934482bb6ca.avif?t=1724196881\" width=322 height=148 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/73d8bc845cc91218e17524f693d55d76.avif?t=1724196881\" width=262 height=156 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/theme.png?t=1724196881\" width=262 height=156 /></span><br><br>\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/e5f7dfa4a9158c7badbb80c76204882d.webp?t=1724196881\" width=397 height=38 /></span><br><br>~ Multi-language Support ~  <br>To meet the needs of players from different regions, the game supports multiple languages. Not only can you use the languages provided with the game, but you can also create your own language configuration files, making the game more closely related to your cultural background.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/71d301b8bcd6ece4d4ade2a200484e05.avif?t=1724196881\" width=320 height=240 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/015aaaff86db0bdf81ec692fb5724b17.avif?t=1724196881\" width=270 height=158 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061330/extras/0e4ebf0dcf2adc68ecf5d66c0c91a858.avif?t